# ip Query (pattern_100): ((Adventure Film --[←film.genre]--> ?) ∩ (United States Dollar --[←dated money value.currency]--> ?)) --[←performance.film]--> ?
# Pattern: 100 (0=KG match, 1=GENOP inference)
